11
Display all the employees who earn less than the average salaries
of their respective departments.
(Correlated Sub Query)
====================================================================

SQL Command:
------------
sql> SELECT EMPNO, ENAME, SAL, DEPTNO
     FROM EMP E
     WHERE SAL <
     (
         SELECT AVG(SAL)
         FROM EMP
         WHERE DEPTNO = E.DEPTNO
     );

